# ST3: demo1 from 44.0 s, the zombies close, in the Classic box (960x600 shown 4:3) with
# the torches' flicker, gliding lights and smooth motion on, and still id's 72 Hz ticks
# (`clock id`).

demo demo1 from 43.0

duration 4.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
clock id
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_torchflicker 1
cvar r_lerplightstyles 1
cvar r_lerpmove 1
cvar r_lerpmodels 1

sound on
events on
